<title>UK: Eskom adds 2.0 bln rand to 30-yr zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Eskom adds 2.0 bln rand to 30-yr zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 8.0 billion rand from 6.0 billion rand, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Toronto Dominion said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ESKOM</p>
<p> AMT    8.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    18.AUG.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  2.60	PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    2.475     YIELD	 12.97 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB+	DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  S.A	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINAL LAUNCHED ON 14.JUL.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
